rivacy Focused Calculator app built with MD3"}, "description": {"en-US": "CalcYou is a privacy focused calculator app that is not just a calculator.\n\nSolve everyday problems with the intuitive basic calculator, or delve into advanced functions with the powerful scientific calculator.\n\nFeeling lost in a sea of units? CalcYou's versatile unit converter can convert lengths, weights, volumes, and more.\n\nNeed to express complex equations? Access a vast library of symbols, including Greek letters, arrows, superscript, and subscript, all with a few taps.\n\nYou want to quickly draw a mathematical function to understand its shape? No worries, CalcYou can plot it for you.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/net.youapps.calcyou/en-US/icon_rrBjgVm4tlar3kzxxN5WCHQykPUsTtmbYBf4SqEM0VM=.png", "sha256": "aeb0638159b8b656abde4cf1c4de5608743290f52c4ed99b6017f84aa10cd153", "size": 24637}}, "preferredSigner": "b3bc73b117df5dfe38130c6c2b946852ae7088557fe8e433f0d9983a6b55cc95"}, "versions": {"ca9e0a308c01d71af65380dbb18a7a760e86a5cb07f559c4326c541be5cf4af6": {"added": 1788711941000, "file": {"name": "/net.youapps.calcyou_11.apk", "sha256": "ca9e0a308c01d71af65380dbb18a7a760e86a5cb07f559c4326c541be5cf4af6", "size": 2327276}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "5.3", "versionCode": 11, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 23, "targetSdkVersion": 35}, "signer": {"sha256": ["b3bc73b117df5dfe38130c6c2b946852ae7088557fe8e433f0d9983a6b55cc95"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "net.youapps.calcyou.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}, "stack.tower3d": {"metadata": {"added": 1788627781000, "categories": ["Action Game", "Casual Game"], "changelog": "https://github.com/Eve-146T/3DStackTower/releases", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/Eve-146T/3DStackTower/issues", "lastUpdated": 1788627781000, "license": "GPL-3.0-only", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/Eve-146T/3DStackTower", "screenshots": {"phone": {"en-US": [{"name": "/stack.tower3d/en-US/phoneScreenshots/1.png", "sha256": "788cdb1be192b21dfd9216b06c439e9019b269d806fdf949955c3f36b118fe6b", "size": 33171}, {"name": "/stack.tower3d/en-US/phoneScreenshots/2.png", "sha256": "a356fe9e1a0f1000a8686d6321c3222800d70c5eb1a3c02dbb0305ee81855b88", "size": 31767}, {"name": "/stack.tower3d/en-US/phoneScreenshots/3.png", "sha256": "7e6840ce21b9bfd64d079078f8e9aee31f7a84f2081a35470b21a2ef1a8f72d0", "size": 49444}, {"name": "/stack.tower3d/en-US/phoneScreenshots/4.png", "sha256": "df567a740f19536b4fad562ec2bc664ba4c2c50a5e63d145dbf7b1ff4aad12b7", "size": 35313}]}}, "authorName": "Eve-146T", "name": {"en-US": "Stack Tower 3D"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Stack sliding blocks into the tallest tower you can. One-tap 3D arcade."}, "description": {"en-US": "There are slides and you click to stack the slides and try to stack them perfectly. Bright colors.\n\nGameplay:\n\n* A block slides back and forth above the tower — tap to drop it.\n* Whatever hangs over the edge is sliced off and tumbles away. Whatever remains is all the next block has to land on.\n* Miss the tower entirely and the run is over.\n* Frame perfect: land within one frame of travel of dead centre and the block keeps its full size, and the placement scores double.\n* The slide speed ramps up as the tower grows, and consecutive frame perfects raise the chime pitch.\n\nStack Tower 3D is free and open-source software, licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. Built with libGDX.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/stack.tower3d/en-US/icon_oSRaxd3LWJe78H4HcntAQoVuFVJgvPR_EOUqxxguaL0=.png", "sha256": "a1245ac5ddcb5897bbf07e07727b4042856e155260bcf47f10e52ac7182e68bd", "size": 516}}, "preferredSigner": "2fe09f50180d92e3b3204992ffc9a8c598087b9a7bac0b12d3f23a1e3687fd7f"}, "versions": {"ba5b0a48d74e33483d9dcb04e2e22ec745ee8e9266188bf9c59f2d2b2883c233": {"added": 1788627781000, "file": {"name": "/3DStackTower-v1.0.0.apk", "sha256": "ba5b0a48d74e33483d9dcb04e2e22ec745ee8e9266188bf9c59f2d2b2883c233", "size": 44